   "seed": 586809934,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1935978190,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1791141205899,
   "created": 1791141205894,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "**Meaning.** More than 14.4% of requests to a service have failed (5xx) over the last hour *and*\nthe last 5 minutes. At this rate the 30-day error budget (1% of requests, SLO 99%) would be used up\nin about 2 days. Users are affected right now.\n**Check**\n1. Grafana \u2192 *Services (RED)* \u2192 error ratio: which service and which environment?\n2. Grafana \u2192 *GitOps Delivery* \u2192 *What version runs where*: did the version change just before the errors started?\n3. `kubectl -n demo-<env> logs deploy/<app> --since=15m`",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "**Meaning.** More than 14.4% of requests to a service have failed (5xx) over the last hour *and*\nthe last 5 minutes. At this rate the 30-day error budget (1% of requests, SLO 99%) would be used up\nin about 2 days. Users are affected right now.\n**Check**\n1. Grafana \u2192 *Services (RED)* \u2192 error ratio: which service and which environment?\n2. Grafana \u2192 *GitOps Delivery* \u2192 *What version runs where*: did the version change just before the errors started?\n3. `kubectl -n demo-<env> logs deploy/<app> --since=15m`",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
